"findings": [
 {"id": "B1", "severity": "major", "test": "(none: no test runs a round through RoundEngine)", "file": "src_mcp/src/Server/Rounds/RoundEngine.cs", "line": 445,
  "summary": "The round's call `results = await _cooldowns.AfterRoundAsync(...)` is covered only by QuotaCooldowns tests that call AfterRoundAsync directly; no test constructs RoundEngine, so deleting this line leaves every test green and no spent quota is ever parked by a round (D5/D11 wiring).",
  "fix": "Add a test that drives one round through RoundEngine or PanelService with a scripted spent antigravity refusal and a /quota probe, then asserts quota-cooldowns.json holds the park and the round's results are unchanged."},
 {"id": "B2", "severity": "major", "test": "ACoolingRowStaysOutOfTheRoundTests", "file": "src_mcp/tests/ACoolingRowStaysOutOfTheRoundTests.cs", "line": 52,
  "summary": "S26–S28 assert only ExcludedFrom (the summary list, PanelService.cs:485); the roster that deals work, which receives CanRun at PanelService.cs:142, is never exercised with a cooling row, so replacing that CanRun with an always-true predicate passes every test while the spent row is still launched.",
  "fix": "Add an assertion through the roster (RosterBuilder fed PanelService's canRun, or BuildWork) that a cooling row is dealt no work at the same instant that ExcludedFrom names it."},
 {"id": "B3", "severity": "minor", "test": "GeminiWeeklySpent_FiveHourDisabled_BlocksUntilTheWeeklyReset_AndThe3pGroupIsAvailable", "file": "src_mcp/tests/TheAgyQuotaReportPicksTheResetTests.cs", "line": 27,
  "summary": "The disabled gemini-5h bucket in QUOTA_SAMPLE sits at remaining_fraction 1, so removing the `!b.Disabled` filter (AgyQuotaReport.cs:162) leaves S9's result unchanged; the disabled flag is only guarded indirectly by the 'every bucket disabled' edge row.",
  "fix": "In S9 set gemini-5h to remaining_fraction 0 with an earlier reset_time than the weekly while keeping disabled true (QuotaFixtures.With), and expect the weekly reset alone, so a parser that counts the disabled bucket changes the answer."}
]}